# Baron Bertram Graywater: "tokens you control" (CR 603.2c): Bot2's two Spirits from Lingering Souls in turn 2 make no
# Vampire Rogue for Bot1, and neither do Bot1's nontoken Mox Jet, Mox Ruby and Pulse Tracker entering. "{1}{B},
# Sacrifice another creature or artifact: Draw a card" (CR 118.3, 701.21): with {1}{B} floating and only Baron and
# lands on the battlefield it can't be activated (Baron isn't "another", a land is neither); then an artifact (Mox Jet,
# turn 3) and a creature (Pulse Tracker, turn 5) are each sacrificed for one card. Hand: 4 after turn 1, the turn-3
# draw 5, the Swamp played and Mox Jet cast 3, the draw 4; the turn-5 draw 5, Swamp, Mox Ruby and Pulse Tracker 2, the
# draw 3.
# Baron Bertram Graywater {2}{W}{B}: Legendary Creature - Vampire Noble 3/4
#   Whenever one or more tokens you control enter, create a 1/1 black Vampire Rogue creature token with lifelink. This
#   ability triggers only once each turn.
#   {1}{B}, Sacrifice another creature or artifact: Draw a card.

